{"name":"Midtown","hex":"#b5a18a","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"midtown","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The part of a city between uptown and downtown."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/midtown"}],"entries":[{"title":"Midtown, Toronto","blocks":[{"text":"Midtown is one of the major districts outside the downtown core of Toronto, Ontario, Canada. Located in the northern part of Old Toronto, its borders are roughly defined by St. Clair Avenue to the south, Eglinton Avenue or Lawrence Avenue to the north, Bayview Avenue to the east and Dufferin Street to the west. The central neighbourhood of the area is Yonge–Eglinton."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b8/Lytton_Park_aerial_view_2025.jpg/330px-Lytton_Park_aerial_view_2025.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Midtown%2C_Toronto","wikidata":"Q6843067"},{"title":"Tokyo Midtown","blocks":[{"text":"Tokyo Midtown  is a 569,000-square-meter mixed-use development in Akasaka, Tokyo, Japan. Completed in March 2007, the $3 billion project includes office, residential, commercial, hotel, and leisure space, and the new quarters of the Suntory Museum of Art. When completed, the Midtown Tower was the tallest building in Tokyo. The main building complex is surrounded by Hinokicho Park, a 10-acre public park containing green areas along with works of art."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f6/Tokyo_Midtown.2.JPG/330px-Tokyo_Midtown.2.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Midtown","wikidata":"Q1364393"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Midtown_Garden_View_201306.jpg/500px-Midtown_Garden_View_201306.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thu